Package: LacqueR
Type: Package
Title: AI-Assisted Interpretation of Statistical Analyses
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        "Sébastien", "Lê",
        email = "sebastien.le@institut-agro.fr",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8814-6714")
    )
    )
Description: Provides a jamovi interface to NaileR for evidence-grounded,
    AI-assisted interpretation of statistical analyses. Statistical evidence,
    generation prompts, and model responses are kept as distinct inspectable
    artifacts. The initial analysis supports sensory quantitative descriptive
    analysis using a locally hosted language model through Ollama. Parts of
    the codebase were developed using AI-assisted code generation and were
    reviewed and tested by the maintainer.
